{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4c34d9e27e2204c83251de3616bfc094fce8f6215423441b12f9b859e1ed07c1","ja":"やっぱり、何事も自分で経験するしかないですよね。\nロマンス……は、私にはまだ早いから……。","zh":"果然，无论什么事都只能靠自己亲身经历呢。\n恋爱……对我来说还太早了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"da57a81fb24aca436750174f2511ef0cfc94f2687ad00f0f1dcf8f4a9599b7b1","ja":"今はとにかく、目の前のことを全力で！\nちょっと自主練してきますね！","zh":"总之现在，眼前的事要全力以赴！我去稍微自主练习一下！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0fb89003e1c589e88ed6e09d3313dfb22d1c13b0192b254880e95f2347568202","ja":"紗代子ちゃん、行っちゃった。\n……ふふ、せっかくだから、私も混ぜてもらおうかな。","zh":"纱代子，走了。\n……呵呵，难得有机会，我也去掺一脚吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"259915ea679be21c87b9254185ce2dacd672c84c25db3451bbea65d524e8a9ca","ja":"あら。そういうことでしたら、わたくしも一緒に……。","zh":"哎呀。如果是那样的话，我也一起……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"79d169b7f27a97b66c8b7a99f91320778d265c48f7c96b394d5ca11cf7f566be","ja":"ちょっと待った。\n千鶴……今、隠し事したよな？","zh":"等一下。\n千鹤……刚才，你是不是有事瞒着我？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"857cae433e7980ed15918a6a53f136e8a920bac4ef9d532eb823916c57f5d317","ja":"ギクッ！！　なっ……ななな、何の話ですの？\nわたくし、何も隠してなんゲホッ、ゲホッ！！","zh":"心头一颤！！　什……什什什，您在说什么呢？\n我、我什么都没有隐瞒，咳、咳！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"db22eb0011ecd188b0982371365b77df30e2290ab66634f282a1dbb6193ddbfa","ja":"いや、いいんだ。\n別に責めようってんじゃない。むしろ逆さ。","zh":"不，没关系的。\n我并不是要责备你。倒不如说正好相反。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"76c123bd83bda26de898ded91059ad4a9d47aa52861cac47fe7c78f114371c0a","ja":"誰だって、ホントのことを隠してカッコつけたい時\nぐらいある。だから、あんま気にするなよ。","zh":"无论是谁，都会有想隐瞒真相、耍帅的时候\n也是有的。所以，别太在意。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d9571f5ba875d89ef142a596bbe15685d8cb4af31c151be5c61eae9b9504bbd7","ja":"……ジュリア？　あなた、まさか……\n気付いていたのですか……！？","zh":"……茱莉亚？　你，难道……\n已经注意到了吗……！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c34dba2e40112a9d9b6fb1090b9eb8a8de21956a83f94031ce75c9bef1456117","ja":"ああ……あたしにはわかってたよ……。","zh":"啊……我早就知道了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"048f9ea98e5d3773f8cf46fcf073543959caea167e9d959616c05a0dd84a97e0","ja":"ホントは恋愛経験あんまないのに、思わせぶりなこと\n言っちゃったんだろ？　あるよな、そういうの！","zh":"其实没什么恋爱经验，却说了些让人误会的话吧？\n这种事也是有的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4ca4100cc1eb1a556e1218863db82f59075fcf84ce88d6d02fcbc1641cc1e40d","ja":"……ええっ？　そ、そこですのーっ！？","zh":"……诶诶？　就、就是那里吗——！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"1fbf0356b3bb266cad419b85e367d88e163848bfd83993e9dfeb7e1ef4284fce","ja":"あれ……なんか、違ったのか？","zh":"咦……好像不太对？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_868.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"fd368f8afffb22a9e9bb25c1b0b4272fdfefbfa00ae8a7bac92d9dcd71af96f6","ja":"あっ。い、いえ……別に、違いませんわ。\nそんなことよりほら、自主練に行きますわよっ！","zh":"啊。不、不是……没什么不一样的。\n比起那个，走吧，我要去自主练习了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
